{
  "title": "Kissed Springy Venezuelan Rice Pilaf",
  "description": "A flavorful and springy Venezuelan dish featuring herbal notes and dried fruit, perfect for crowds, this pilaf is a nut-free friendly option that combines the best of fry-grind-rice-khao-khua techniques.",
